      "description": "A concrete value for the field being checked (`text` when it is a string, `number` when it is a number). If it does not fit, it is reported as mismatch and what follows is ignored.",
      "from": [
        "ACTIVE",
        "CHECKING",
        "SETTLED",
        "INACTIVE"
      ],
      "name": "Constant",
      "onlyIf": [],
      "when": {
        "A given field is being checked, and the concrete value does not fit it": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "mismatch",
                "field": {
                  "$ref": "data:checkedField"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "SETTLED"
        },
        "otherwise": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "asks": {
        "fieldIsGiven": {
          "input": {
            "field": {
              "$ref": "input:name"
            }
          },
          "query": "fieldGiven"
        }
      },
      "description": "A field the slot declares. In a slot that is checked and whose declared fields must all be given (an effect, an asked query, a contained component's command, an answer with fields), a field the specification does not give is reported as missing-field. The field being checked, if any, stays as it is.",
      "from": [
        "INACTIVE",
        "ACTIVE",
        "CHECKING",
        "SETTLED"
      ],
      "name": "DeclaredField",
      "onlyIf": [],
      "when": {
        "The slot's fields are checked, its declared fields must all be given (an effect, an asked query, a contained component's command, an answer with fields), and the specification does not give this field": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "missing-field",
                "field": {
                  "$ref": "input:name"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "otherwise": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "The walk enters a slot, with what is known about it. Its kind is remembered, and whether it is an answer of variants. Whether its fields are checked, and what is reported about the slot as a whole (as the empty field), depends on the kind: an effect that is not declared is not checked (it is reported elsewhere). An asked query that is not declared is reported as unknown-target and not checked. For a contained component's command: a part that is not declared is unknown-target; otherwise a part asked with a key it does not have (or without the key it needs) is keyed-mismatch (keyedOk false); otherwise a command the part does not have is unknown-command; in any of these cases it is not checked. A contained component created or removed (change) that is not declared as one of many is unknown-target. A command's answer (responds): with no declared output, an answer that is given is no-output and nothing is checked; with an output declared and no answer given, missing-response and not checked; with fields declared and a single value given, wrong-shape and not checked; with variants declared and not exactly one field given (or a single value), wrong-shape and not checked; with a single value declared and fields given, wrong-shape and not checked. Every other slot is checked.",
      "from": [
        "OUTSIDE"
      ],
      "name": "EnterSlot",
      "onlyIf": [],
      "when": {
        "The slot is a command's answer that is given, and fields are declared and a single value given, or variants are declared and a single value or not exactly one field is given, or a single value is declared and fields are given": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "wrong-shape",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is a command's answer, the command declares an output, and no answer is given": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "missing-response",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is a command's answer, the command declares no output, and an answer is given": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "no-output",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is a contained component's command, the part is declared and asked as it should be, and the part does not have the command": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "unknown-command",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is a contained component's command, the part is declared, and it is asked with a key it does not have or without the key it needs": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "keyed-mismatch",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is an asked query, a contained component's command, or a contained component created or removed (change), and its target is not declared": {
          "emits": [
            {
              "effect": "Report",
              "input": {
                "code": "unknown-target",
                "field": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "The slot is an effect that is not declared": {
          "goTo": "INACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        },
        "otherwise": {
          "goTo": "ACTIVE",
          "set": {
            "checkedField": "",
            "slotKind": {
              "$ref": "input:kind"
            },
            "variants": {
              "$ref": "calculation:isVariants"
            }
          }
        }
      }
